# WebGPU semantic L2

For 语义加深 / 真实编组 / described L2 / host-fixed guest fields, read `docs/agent/webgpu-semantic-l2.md` and follow it.

- Do not WebFetch wasi-webgpu. Use `third_party/wasi-webgpu/v0.3.0-rc.2/wit/webgpu.wit`.
- Do not Read `native/src/cm.rs` or `native/src/jvm.rs` without offset. Grep, then ~80 lines.
- One product `[method]` per PR. Copy the `create-buffer` described stack; do not scan extra tests.
- Do not add `HostArg` string/bytes unless the user named a string-bearing method. No `gpu-canvas-context`.
- Hub freeze: no root README / `CHANGELOG.md` / `ci.yml` / `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
- Remaining: `.\scripts\webgpu-semantic-l2-remaining.ps1`
